[en.FOCUS_C18_110_OPEN_TO_UNICORNIA]
Friendship with Unicornia

[en.FOCUS_C18_110_OPEN_TO_UNICORNIA_desc]
Unicornia is a peculiar neighbor, their existence is a secret to us, but we can try to establish friendship with them.\nWe are not sure what the centenarian ruler of Unicornia is thinking, only that they seem to need flowers very much, thousands of flowers...

[zh.FOCUS_C18_110_OPEN_TO_UNICORNIA]
与仙境的友谊

[zh.FOCUS_C18_110_OPEN_TO_UNICORNIA_desc]
独角兽仙境是一个古怪的邻居，他们的存在对我们来说是一个秘密，但我们可以尝试与他们建立友谊。\n我们并不清楚仙境那边上百岁的统治者究竟在想些什么，只知道他们似乎很需要花朵，成千上万的花朵...

